{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19903","headline":"初於洛中选 · 孟郊","name":"初於洛中选","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘土日易没，驱驰力无余。\n青云不我与，白首方选书。\n宦途事非远，拙者取自疎。\n终然恋皇邑，誓以结吾庐。\n帝城富高门，京路遶胜居。\n碧水走龙蛇，蜿蜒遶庭除。\n寻常异方客，过此亦踟蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}